NAME
       cfm - file manager

SYNOPSIS
       cfm [directory]

DESCRIPTION
       A full-screen file manager: the listing on the left, a preview
       on the right. Text files are previewed as text, directories as
       their contents, and images are drawn on the framebuffer.
       Animated GIFs play in the preview panel as soon as they are
       selected, and full screen when opened.

KEYS
       arrows, PgUp, PgDn, Home, End   move around
       Enter, right   open (directory, or view the file)
       Backspace, left   go up
       e        run the selected file
       r        rename          d   delete
       c        copy            x   cut          v   paste
       n        make a directory
       .        show hidden files
       s        settings
       q        quit

SETTINGS
       The settings menu covers the preview pane, confirmation before
       deleting, hidden files, sort order (name, size or type), the
       width of the preview pane and GIF animation. Save settings
       writes them to ~/.cfmrc, which is read at startup.

FILES
       ~/.cfmrc

SEE ALSO
       neo(1), img(1), ls(1)
